1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,448
You think my army
is hunting you?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Well... they're holding spears.
What do you think?

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,068
Those soldiers no longer serve me.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,808
Wait. Then who's controlling them?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,408
The man I trusted
with my entire kingdom.

6
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,456
General Zukar.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,512
Zukar was my greatest commander.
He protected this city.

8
00:00:24,662 --> 00:00:25,550
Was?

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,628
He wants my throne.
And he wants the ancient seal.

10
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,580
So he's basically the bad guy?

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,288
He will burn this city
to become its king.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,784
These symbols aren't names.
They're instructions.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,360
Look. Four symbols...
and one missing.

14
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:49,494
The prophecy says four strangers
will end the kingdom.

15
00:00:49,644 --> 00:00:52,116
So we're supposed to destroy this place?

16
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:55,654
No. You must end the rule
that is destroying it.

17
00:00:55,804 --> 00:00:59,428
The seal is hidden at
the Temple of the First Dawn.

18
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,868
Take this seal to the temple.
It will open the final chamber.

19
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,004
What about you?

20
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,136
I will hold the palace.

21
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:14,580
My king! Zukar's men have entered
the royal courtyard!

22
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:16,698
Then we have no more time.

23
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,848
That's him. The general.

24
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,448
If he sees us, we're finished.

25
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,936
The old king has betrayed you!
His four strangers will bring
the kingdom to ruin!

26
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:37,668
He's not looking for the king anymore.

27
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:39,092
He's looking for this.

28
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,772
I've got this!

29
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,160
You almost had a very
different ending!

30
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,592
Guys! Less talking,
more moving!

31
00:01:48,742 --> 00:01:50,014
They're coming!

32
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,396
This has to be the place.

33
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,560
The symbols match.

34
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,724
Then open it!

35
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,612
Guys... I think
we found it.

36
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,484
You should never have
opened that door.

37
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,992
You have got to be
kidding me.

38
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:19,756
How did he get here
so fast?

39
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:22,372
Look at the tablet...

40
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,336
Now... give me
the seal.

41
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,228
Yeah. That's not happening.

42
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:30,000
THE FINAL KINGDOM IS WAITING...

